  "provenance": "OfficeIMO-authored OOXML intake imported into Numbers. C2:D8 on each sheet is explicitly set to Duration, abbreviated labels, fixed custom units; D2:D8 is replaced with native C+C formulas. Saved locally, then exported by Numbers with one XLSX worksheet per source sheet and one PDF page per sheet. Source duration caches and formats are independently decoded with numbers-parser 4.19.0. Excel observations open the unchanged Apple XLSX export without saving.",
